        "Items.CosmicAscendidoBlackHoleStaff.DisplayName": "Ascended Cosmic Staff",
        "Items.OlvidoAscendidoBlackHoleStaff.DisplayName": "Ascended Olvido Staff",

        "Items.VoidCrownItem.DisplayName": "Crown of the Void Queen",
        "Items.VoidCrownItem.Tooltip": "The original crown of the crimson black hole, now a wearable cosmetic.\nFive crimson neon arcs with orange knots arched JUST BEHIND your head.\nPure cosmetic: no stats. Works in accessory or vanity slots.",

        "Items.RuneCrownItem.DisplayName": "Astral Rune Crown",
        "Items.RuneCrownItem.Tooltip": "A new crown designed from scratch: eight runic glyphs of fuchsia light\nfloating in an arc above your head, each tipped with a pale-pink pearl.\nPure cosmetic: no stats. Works in accessory or vanity slots.",

